p/w300/l5mRc6YpZYVI4pb1ccbTZ1GmYLm.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvVGhlLVRydW5rLTIwMjQv.1.4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"episode":4,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"As In-ji creates a homey life and instills peace around Jeong-won, he grapples with his growing desire for her. Seo-yeon can't handle losing control.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/qV4kkgxKJIhqyMKN67xrlQ5NMXA.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvVGhlLVRydW5rLTIwMjQv.1.5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"episode":5,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Jeong-won learns about Eom Tae-seong and offers help, but In-ji rebuffs him. Seo-yeon gets a grim warning. Later, the wife and ex-wife clash at a funeral.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/5LLPKqs3uBANfXAcsqfBV29gu0Q.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvVGhlLVRydW5rLTIwMjQv.1.6","title":"Episode 6","season":1,"episode":6,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Seo-yeon demands an end to their tangled relationship, and In-ji boldly confronts her. Meanwhile, a mysterious figure lurks near Seo Do-ha's apartment.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/7808ApHPSHYWWJB1NO1VGXeVy4X.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvVGhlLVRydW5rLTIwMjQv.1.7","title":"Episode 7","season":1,"episode":7,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"Shocked by the bloody corridor, In-ji steps into Do-ha's apartment with trepidation. Who or what will she find, and will she finally get closure?","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/nSEZM5FeFvPvGYWhMZZje2CKpZH.jpg"},{"id":"dm.aHR0cDovL3NlcnZlcjEuZGhha2Ftb3ZpZS5jb20vVHZfU2hvd3MvS29yZWFuLzIwMjQvVGhlLVRydW5rLTIwMjQv.1.8","title":"Episode 8","season":1,"episode":8,"released":"2024-11-29T00:00:00.000Z","overview":"After learning of Seo-yeon's betrayal, Jeong-won cu